{
  "_comment": "Shared terrain type library for map format v2. Each entry under 'types' is an EFFECT LIST — the full set of gameplay/visual effects a tile of that type carries. New terrain = a new entry here (plus a legend character in a map file); no code changes required. 'legend' is the DEFAULT char->type mapping maps can inherit; a map may override it locally with its own 'legend' object.",

  "legend": {
    ".": "grass",
    "f": "forest",
    "h": "hills",
    "M": "mountain",
    "~": "water",
    "r": "river",
    "m": "marsh",
    "u": "urban",
    "s": "sand"
  },

